Smart Event Management Platform — Module 2

Internee: Mahzaib Irshad Internship ID: ZYNVEX-CERT-1049 Program: Web Development Module: 2 of 4 — Event Details, Search & Filtering Submission window: Aug 31 – Sep 6, 2026

📌 About This Module

Module 2 builds directly on the Module 1 homepage. It adds the ability to open a full details view for any event, and to search and filter the event grid live — by keyword, and by category — before deciding which event to explore further.

✅ What's Implemented in Module 2
 Event details view — shows full info (image/glyph, category, title, date, location, seats left, description) for a single event
 Card-to-details navigation — clicking any event card opens that event's details and hides the browse grid
 "Back to Events" navigation from the details view
 Live search bar — filters events by title, location, or category as the user types
 Category filter chips — auto-generated from the event data, with active-state styling
 Combined search + category filtering (both apply together, not independently)
 Empty-state message when no events match the current search/filter combination